---
// Support page: the App Store listing's Support URL, so /support must not
// change. Answers here describe how the app works (dusty repo, 2026-11-03).
import TextPage from '../layouts/TextPage.astro';
import { contact, links } from '../data/site';
---

<TextPage title="Help and support" description="Get help with Dusty: bookings, payments, cancellations, your account and safety.">
  <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-violet-50 border border-violet-100 p-6">
    <p class="!mb-2 font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact us</p>
    <p class="!mb-1">
      Email <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>
    </p>
    <p class="!mb-1">
      WhatsApp or call <a href={links.whatsapp}>{contact.phoneDisplay}</a>
    </p>
    <p class="!mb-0 text-sm text-gray-600">
      We aim to reply within one working day. In the app, go to Account → Contact us. If someone is in danger, call 999
      first.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="booking">Booking</h2>
  <h3>How do I book a cleaner?</h3>
  <p>
    Open the Book tab, choose the type of clean, the day and the time, and tap Find my cleaner. Or tap Describe it and
    tell Ask Dusty what you need in your own words. You'll see your best match, with their price and reviews, before
    you book.
  </p>
  <h3>When will the cleaner reply?</h3>
  <p>
    Cleaners get a notification straight away and usually reply within a few hours. If they decline or don't reply in
    time, the request is cancelled, your card hold is released and you can book someone else.
  </p>
  <h3>Can I message my cleaner?</h3>
  <p>
    Yes. Open the booking to message or call them. Calls go through Dusty's number, so neither of you sees the other's
    phone number. You can also ask a cleaner a question before you book.
  </p>
  <h3>Is Dusty in my area?</h3>
  <p>
    We're starting in Birmingham, Coventry and the West Midlands. If Dusty can't find a cleaner near you yet,
    <a href="/#early-access">join the waitlist</a> and we'll tell you when we arrive.
  </p>

  <h2 id="payment">Payment</h2>
  <h3>When am I charged?</h3>
  <p>
    When you book, we put a hold on your card for the price shown. You're only charged once the cleaner marks the
    clean as done. If the booking doesn't go ahead, the hold is released. Your bank may take a few days to show it.
  </p>
  <h3>What appears on my bank statement?</h3>
  <p>Payments show as DUSTY.</p>
  <h3>How do points work?</h3>
  <p>Every 250 points gives you £10 off a booking. You can choose to use them when you book.</p>

  <h2 id="cancelling">Cancelling and changes</h2>
  <h3>How do I cancel or reschedule?</h3>
  <p>Open the booking in the Bookings tab. You can cancel it or ask to move it to another time from there.</p>
  <h3>Is there a fee?</h3>
  <p>
    Cancelling is free until 48 hours before the start (24 hours for a repeat clean). After that, the late cancellation
    fee is 50% of the price, because the cleaner kept that time free for you. If the cleaner cancels, you're never
    charged. See our <a href="/terms#customers">terms</a> for the details.
  </p>
  <h3>Something went wrong with my clean</h3>
  <p>
    Tell us within 48 hours at <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>, with photos if you can.
    We'll look into it with you and the cleaner.
  </p>

  <h2 id="safety">Safety</h2>
  <h3>How are cleaners checked?</h3>
  <p>
    Every cleaner uploads ID, right to work and proof of address, and our team checks them by hand before the cleaner
    can take a booking. Cleaners with insurance show an Insured badge on their profile.
  </p>
  <h3>How do I report or block someone?</h3>
  <p>
    In a message thread or on someone's profile, use the report or block option. Blocking cancels any
    bookings between you that haven't started, free of charge. Our team reviews every report.
  </p>

  <h2 id="cleaners">For cleaners</h2>
  <h3>How do I join?</h3>
  <p>
    Download Dusty, choose "Clean for Dusty", set your rate, services, area and hours, and upload your documents. We
    usually check them within 2 working days.
  </p>
  <h3>When do I get paid?</h3>
  <p>
    After each clean you complete, you receive the price minus Dusty's 20% commission, paid to your bank through
    Stripe. Set up payouts in the app first.
  </p>

  <h2 id="account">Your account</h2>
  <h3>I forgot my password</h3>
  <p>On the sign-in screen, tap Forgot password? and we'll email you a link.</p>
  <h3>How do I delete my account?</h3>
  <p>
    In the app, go to Account → Delete account. You'll be signed out straight away and have 30 days to change your
    mind by signing back in. After that your account is erased. You can't delete it while a booking is in progress.
    Our <a href="/privacy#retention">privacy policy</a> explains what we have to keep.
  </p>
  <h3>Can I get a copy of my data?</h3>
  <p>Yes. Email <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> and we'll send it within one month.</p>
</TextPage>
